1. Reverse a String
-------------------
    String str = "hello";
    String reversed = "";
    
    for (int i = str.length() - 1; i >= 0; i--) {
        reversed += str.charAt(i);
    }
    System.out.println(reversed);

2. Reverse words in a String
----------------------------
    String str = "Java is easy";
    
    String[] words = str.split(" ");
    String result = "";
    
    for (int i = words.length - 1; i >= 0; i--) {
        result += words[i] + " ";
    }
